==Description==
A template that presents the view or play counts of a song.
Retreived from: {{VW|Template:V|Vocaloid Wiki}}

==Parameters==
; <code>1=</code>
: [[Template:External/doc|Website abbreviation]].
; <code>2=</code>
: View or play count.
:* It doesn't matter if there is a comma; <code><nowiki>{{v|yt|1500123}}</nowiki></code> is just as valid as <code><nowiki>{{v|yt|1500,123}}</nowiki></code>. Even <code><nowiki>{{v|yt|150,0,12,3}}</nowiki></code> is okay, because the code removes all commas before processing.
:* Rounding of the view count is automatic.

